WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.600
Symphony helps you connect what matters in your

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:04.580
life with what you need to do today.

00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:07.270
In Symphony, you can break a big goal

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:10.190
into smaller goals, then choose tasks that help

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:10.870
you achieve them.
